{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"No","category":"储能","country":"英国","country_iso":"GBR","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:47:06.959157","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"GBR-ES-0005","ldc":"No","location":"","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"英国140MWh电网级储能项目","project_name_en":"UK 140MWh Grid-Scale Energy Storage Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"晶科能源","content":"近日，晶科储能（Jinko ESS）与英国领先的能源开发商AGR可再生能源公司（AGR Renewables）达成了一项140MWh电网级储能项目协议。该项目将采用28套晶科储能的G2 5MWh液冷集装箱式系统，首批设备计划于2025年11月交付，项目调试预计在2026年第一季度完成。\nG2系统专为应对英国严苛的环境条件而设计，可承受高纬度地区低至零下10摄氏度的严寒以及持续潮湿的天气，兼具坚固设计与智能性能。该系统采用先进的液冷技术，确保电芯温差控制在±2.5°C以内，即使在极端寒冷条件下也能保持94%以上的充放电效率。\n该系统同时满足高标准的环保和运行安全要求，具备IP55防护等级可抵御雨雪侵袭，并通过符合国际及当地标准的多层级安全防护设计。此外，其集成的AI智能云管理平台可优化充放电策略，最大化能源利用效率。“此次项目合作标志着晶科储能的技术在英国市场获得了高度认可，”晶科储能欧洲区总经理Roberto Murgioni表示，“G2系统非常适合英国的特殊环境条件，将在支持该国清洁能源转型中发挥重要作用。”\n这一里程碑项目签署巩固了晶科储能在欧洲市场的地位，彰显了其致力于提供可靠、高效、智能的储能解决方案，以加速全球向可再生能源转型的决心。\n“我们很高兴能与行业领先储能系统供应商之一的晶科储能合作，以支持我们在英国不断增长的项目组合落地。该合同的签署标志着我们在降低项目交付风险方面取得了重大进展，也进一步印证了AGR在英国推进储能基础设施建设的长期愿景与承诺，”AGR公司创始人Oliver Breidt表示。","content_sha256":"f078945bf1b6935659999a2cde6f527f8647ec591c5042af835ebabbbd3b70e9","id":2555,"publish_date":"2025-08-02 11:45:56","title":"晶科储能与英国AGR公司达成140MWh电网级储能项目合作","title_sha256":"5a496a65b5322b9571407357c66841cd90ea553231cb2b1cd245eb922d228858","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/85982.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"GBR-ES-0005","capacity_details":"BESS: 140MWh","capacity_mw":140.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"140","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:47:06.959484","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"GBR-ES-0005-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.jinkosolar.com/site/newsdetail/2707\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"AGR可再生能源公司","project_developer_en":"AGR Renewable Energy Company","project_stage":"签约","project_summary":"晶科储能与英国AGR公司合作，在英国建设一个140MWh的电网级储能项目。该项目将采用晶科储能的G2液冷集装箱式系统，首批设备计划于2025年11月交付，项目调试预计在2026年第一季度完成。","publish_date":"2025-08-02 11:45:56","pv_capacity_mw":null,"source_links":"[\"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/85982.html\"]","storage_energy_mwh":140.0,"storage_power_mw":null,"total_investment_usd":null,"total_investment_usd_raw":"","transmission_capacity_mw":null,"verification_confidence":null,"verification_sources":null,"verification_status":"unverified","voltage_kv":null}}],"evidence_policy":{"exact_quote_required":true,"quote_must_not_cross_surfaces":true,"valid_surfaces":["title","body"]},"project_id":"GBR-ES-0005","schema_version":"storage-taxonomy-evidence-package-v1","selection_reasons":["existing_storage_numeric","storage_text_signal"]}
